veloping. The move **P: b2-b3** attacks the black queen and forces it to move, opening lines for the bishop and queen’s rook later. It also avoids moving the king unnecessarily and doesn’t overextend like d4-d5 yet (which could leave d4 weak).  \n\n**Answer:** P: b2-b3'}
